      <title>GateKeeper Mode: Building a Quality Gate Before Letting AI Touch Your Code</title>
      <link>https://jmaaa32.github.io/posts/gatekeeper-mode-building-a-quality-gate-before-letting-ai-touch-your-code/</link>
